Version
-------

The vendored CSS states no version number. Its feature set —
`select2-selection--single` / `--multiple`, the `--clearable` choice
remove, `select2-selection__choice__display`, the `--inline` search, and
the `select2-container--{above,below,classic,default,disabled,focus,open}`
container modifiers — places it in the Select2 4.x line. The Select2 release
the compiled deck loads is recorded separately in the deployment config
(`src/card/render/deployment-follow-live-config.ts`, the `scriptIntegrityBySrc`
entry for `select2.full.min.js`). No exact patch version is claimed here,
because the vendored file does not state one. The Bootstrap 5 adaptation of
this stylesheet is a separate component, in `../select2-bootstrap-5-theme/`.

